    "detailed_description": "Instead of Wukong, you\u2019re the chosen one to start the journey to the west. But you\u2019re not as omnipotent as Wukong, so the golden cudgel takes over\u2026 Control the golden cudgel to finish the journey !<br>There are also 81 (27 in each of the 3 chapters) difficulties (mark as skulls) on your journey, try to collect all of them!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Control</h2>A and D control the rotation in the left and right directions.<br>The space controls the extension of the golden cudgel.<br>W controls the transmission to the landing point of the golden cudgel.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Last But Not Least,</h2>Don\u2019t get mad while playing. Practice more and you\u2019ll get used to it.<br>Physics here is managed by the Chinese Immortals, instead of Newton.<br><br>Enjoy!",
    "about_the_game": "Instead of Wukong, you\u2019re the chosen one to start the journey to the west. But you\u2019re not as omnipotent as Wukong, so the golden cudgel takes over\u2026 Control the golden cudgel to finish the journey !<br>There are also 81 (27 in each of the 3 chapters) difficulties (mark as skulls) on your journey, try to collect all of them!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Control</h2>A and D control the rotation in the left and right directions.<br>The space controls the extension of the golden cudgel.<br>W controls the transmission to the landing point of the golden cudgel.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Last But Not Least,</h2>Don\u2019t get mad while playing. Practice more and you\u2019ll get used to it.<br>Physics here is managed by the Chinese Immortals, instead of Newton.<br><br>Enjoy!",
    "short_description": "Umm\u2026 Just a 3D precision platformer game about Journey to The West. Might be a bit difficult.",
